
@startuml
title Figure 4 — Windowing, overlap, hop

' --- Minimal, compact style for sequence diagrams ---
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam Participant {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
scale 0.9


participant "Acquisition Manager" as AM

== Window 1 ==
activate AM
note over AM
Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate AM

... hop_s = win_s * (1 - overlap) ...

== Window 2 ==
activate AM
note over AM
Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate AM

note over AM
Example: win_s = 5 s,
overlap = 0.8 -> hop_s = 1.0 s
end note

@enduml
